      ],
      "text": "**I’d skip outdoor exercise in Jurong right now.** The latest readings I found show **high PM2.5 in the West** (about **221 µg/m³**) and an **unhealthy PSI**; NEA advises avoiding strenuous outdoor activity when PM2.5 is in the high band. It’s also around **31°C**. ([haze.sg](https://www.haze.sg/))\n\nExercise indoors instead. If you need to go out, keep it brief and check NEA’s **myENV** app for the latest local reading first—the air can change.([nea.gov.sg](https://www.nea.gov.sg/media/news/advisories/index/haze-situation-update-16-october-2026))",
